VFR is expected to persist through the remainder of today and
tonight for a majority of the terminals. Monterey Bay sites may
see a return of MVFR/IFR ceilings in the hours after midnight but
confidence is low in the extent and timing of stratus
redevelopment while the marine layer attempts to reorganize this
weekend in the wake of the weak cold front passing east today.

